  "question": {
    "text": "A block is hanged from spring in a cage. Elongation in spring is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math> mm when cage moves up and down respectively with same acceleration. The expansion (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi></math>) in spring when the cage moves horizontally with the same acceleration.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>2